[{"start":11786.96,"end":11787.06,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":11787.54,"end":11789.4,"text":"Let's see if I can get this thing going properly."},{"start":11790.64,"end":11791.26,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":11794.02,"end":11796.6,"text":"So we just need to change the presentation."},{"start":11796.76,"end":11798.12,"text":"And now it will be"},{"start":11799.8,"end":11803.7,"text":"at least a little bit different, because now we're moving a little bit"},{"start":11803.76,"end":11806.32,"text":"from all this with validation to"},{"start":11806.82,"end":11807.84,"text":"verification."},{"start":11808.88,"end":11810.42,"text":"What the human"},{"start":11811.34,"end":11812.66,"text":"eye and brain"},{"start":11813.94,"end":11817.46,"text":"probably for at least some more time is needed for."},{"start":11820.84,"end":11821.72,"text":"Yeah, thanks."},{"start":11824.34,"end":11828.12,"text":"I'm Mor Aronsson from the Swedish Species Information Centre,"},{"start":11828.48,"end":11832.12,"text":"and I'm also the node for"},{"start":11832.64,"end":11832.82,"text":"our"},{"start":11833.68,"end":11837.62,"text":"quality work on observation at our unit"},{"start":11837.68,"end":11837.88,"text":"or"},{"start":11838.94,"end":11839.2,"text":"for"},{"start":11842.24,"end":11845.4,"text":"most of the observation that is reported in Sweden."},{"start":11848.54,"end":11850,"text":"Now we will see what..."},{"start":11855.36,"end":11856.92,"text":"It should work. These two."},{"start":11857.1,"end":11858.82,"text":"These two. Okay, thanks."},{"start":11860.68,"end":11861,"text":"Okay."},{"start":11862.1,"end":11866.08,"text":"What is quality? Very much focus has been on"},{"start":11867.04,"end":11868.1,"text":"what species it is."},{"start":11868.98,"end":11872.2,"text":"If the taxonomy is right, it is right named."},{"start":11873.28,"end":11877.26,"text":"But the last, I will say 10 years, it has been more"},{"start":11877.28,"end":11880.92,"text":"and more focus also on that the position is right,"},{"start":11881.5,"end":11883.82,"text":"especially when you're dealing with"},{"start":11885.14,"end":11887.74,"text":"species that have some legal"},{"start":11888.66,"end":11889.5,"text":"relationship."},{"start":11890.54,"end":11890.86,"text":"And"},{"start":11892.1,"end":11892.18,"text":"if"},{"start":11893.3,"end":11895.64,"text":"some of them are red listed, that should be protected,"},{"start":11896.68,"end":11899.24,"text":"or as there are something that are"},{"start":11900.38,"end":11903.62,"text":"sensitive, it's also very important to know exactly where it is."},{"start":11903.7,"end":11903.92,"text":"So"},{"start":11905.66,"end":11906.5,"text":"the position is"},{"start":11908.16,"end":11910.34,"text":"hiding the right way, and"},{"start":11911.26,"end":11911.76,"text":"since"},{"start":11912.7,"end":11914.74,"text":"for us in European Union,"},{"start":11916.26,"end":11920.2,"text":"the Invasive Species Regulation come, it's also very"},{"start":11922.02,"end":11925.88,"text":"important to know where to eradicate things."},{"start":11928.48,"end":11932.32,"text":"But also the timing, of course, when it"},{"start":11932.36,"end":11933.04,"text":"was found."},{"start":11934.12,"end":11937.98,"text":"That's normally not a problem in modern observation"},{"start":11938.02,"end":11941.24,"text":"because it's reported when it's found"},{"start":11942.46,"end":11944.7,"text":"in most cases. And also"},{"start":11945.58,"end":11949.52,"text":"who found it, at least in our national system, you"},{"start":11949.62,"end":11951.78,"text":"need to have a personal account. So"},{"start":11952.64,"end":11955.06,"text":"you can't really be"},{"start":11956.34,"end":11960.26,"text":"Donald Duck or something. You need to be a person with an"},{"start":11960.38,"end":11960.84,"text":"email."},{"start":11964.74,"end":11965.08,"text":"And"},{"start":11967.36,"end":11967.68,"text":"as"},{"start":11970.08,"end":11973.54,"text":"more and more observation is online, there is more"},{"start":11974.76,"end":11976.8,"text":"and more question on quality,"},{"start":11977.78,"end":11979.62,"text":"and also from"},{"start":11980.52,"end":11981.9,"text":"both sides."},{"start":11983.1,"end":11983.92,"text":"People or"},{"start":11984.8,"end":11985.94,"text":"agencies and"},{"start":11986.94,"end":11987.58,"text":"consult"},{"start":11989.1,"end":11989.66,"text":"companies"},{"start":11990.48,"end":11993.52,"text":"need more quality and"},{"start":11994.52,"end":11997.48,"text":"as I already mentioned, some of the legal acts."},{"start":11998.34,"end":11999.38,"text":"And we also have"},{"start":12001.04,"end":12004.8,"text":"the opposite. There are some companies, forest"},{"start":12004.86,"end":12008.64,"text":"companies for instance, criticize a lot of,"},{"start":12008.96,"end":12011.42,"text":"\"Oh, yeah, we can't believe these"},{"start":12012.4,"end":12014.42,"text":"orchid positions because"},{"start":12015.98,"end":12019.26,"text":"it's just whoever has reported it.\""},{"start":12020.82,"end":12021.14,"text":"And"},{"start":12022.48,"end":12026.46,"text":"today, we also have more and more help of AI,"},{"start":12027.32,"end":12028.48,"text":"but we also have"},{"start":12029.92,"end":12030.04,"text":"the"},{"start":12031.58,"end":12033.56,"text":"backlash of AI, how"},{"start":12035.64,"end":12037.42,"text":"much people trust it."},{"start":12038.76,"end":12039.3,"text":"Because"},{"start":12041.3,"end":12041.96,"text":"it's still"},{"start":12043.6,"end":12047.52,"text":"a border there between to use the AI and"},{"start":12048.74,"end":12052.58,"text":"not to use it. So we had to be a little bit careful"},{"start":12052.66,"end":12055.84,"text":"in that sense also to be trusted both by the"},{"start":12055.9,"end":12059.4,"text":"reporters and by the users. So it's a"},{"start":12059.7,"end":12062.02,"text":"learning process by the society"},{"start":12062.88,"end":12063.1,"text":"on"},{"start":12064.26,"end":12064.82,"text":"the AI."},{"start":12065.94,"end":12066.26,"text":"And"},{"start":12067.836,"end":12069.356,"text":"I'm quite sure that for"},{"start":12070.856,"end":12074.736,"text":"rather long time still, we need the human eye and brain"},{"start":12074.816,"end":12075.076,"text":"to"},{"start":12076.036,"end":12079.256,"text":"set the last stamp on the observation that"},{"start":12079.456,"end":12081.036,"text":"this is correct."},{"start":12085.116,"end":12087.576,"text":"And what is verified in our Swedish system,"},{"start":12088.896,"end":12090.276,"text":"traditionally rare birds,"},{"start":12092.216,"end":12094.236,"text":"new species to the country,"},{"start":12096.276,"end":12097.816,"text":"extreme outliers or"},{"start":12098.916,"end":12099.176,"text":"even"},{"start":12101.016,"end":12101.916,"text":"other outliers."},{"start":12102.776,"end":12106.096,"text":"Threatened species has, of course, been also a"},{"start":12106.496,"end":12109.596,"text":"bigger focus on, and since the regulation"},{"start":12110.576,"end":12114.356,"text":"for invasive species came into force for"},{"start":12114.456,"end":12115.516,"text":"about 10 years ago,"},{"start":12116.876,"end":12120.196,"text":"those listed species has also been on high concern."},{"start":12122.576,"end":12122.876,"text":"And"},{"start":12124.116,"end":12127.876,"text":"those classes we are working with in Sweden, it's"},{"start":12128.576,"end":12129.756,"text":"a couple of different,"},{"start":12131.876,"end":12134.996,"text":"okay classes. That's everything from,"},{"start":12136.676,"end":12139.436,"text":"that is an expert that has"},{"start":12139.956,"end":12143.876,"text":"determined a sample up to just that we"},{"start":12144.856,"end":12146.496,"text":"believe the reporter."},{"start":12147.536,"end":12150.696,"text":"It could be a known person we know. Okay,"},{"start":12151.636,"end":12155.136,"text":"he or she knows this species and have done"},{"start":12155.856,"end":12159.276,"text":"lots of earlier records that has been correct."},{"start":12160.496,"end":12162.756,"text":"But this is the scale. And then we have"},{"start":12164.416,"end":12166.496,"text":"only one that not approved,"},{"start":12167.696,"end":12171.316,"text":"and that's used as little as possible"},{"start":12171.376,"end":12174.776,"text":"because we try to have a dialogue with the reporter"},{"start":12176.776,"end":12180.496,"text":"to change or get more information if there are some curious."},{"start":12181.016,"end":12184.796,"text":"So that is mainly used for when we don't reach the reporter"},{"start":12184.896,"end":12188.476,"text":"or the reporter is dead already or"},{"start":12188.516,"end":12188.896,"text":"something."},{"start":12192.116,"end":12192.336,"text":"So"},{"start":12194.736,"end":12196.356,"text":"what are we really doing? We have been"},{"start":12197.396,"end":12198.016,"text":"doing this,"},{"start":12198.836,"end":12200.476,"text":"started already for 25 years"},{"start":12201.296,"end":12204.956,"text":"since the Artportalen was started, the first"},{"start":12205.036,"end":12206.316,"text":"version of Artportalen."},{"start":12207.196,"end":12210.576,"text":"Our main system has this"},{"start":12212.036,"end":12214.456,"text":"verification system already for the birds."},{"start":12216.336,"end":12216.896,"text":"Today,"},{"start":12217.736,"end":12221.716,"text":"we also change or we are straightened up"},{"start":12221.856,"end":12223.916,"text":"very much around the verification."},{"start":12224.736,"end":12226.316,"text":"We have an education"},{"start":12228.096,"end":12229.616,"text":"of all the people that should"},{"start":12230.596,"end":12232.036,"text":"verify the observations."},{"start":12232.936,"end":12235.816,"text":"We write a contract with them that they should,"},{"start":12236.636,"end":12240.136,"text":"especially those who has right to"},{"start":12240.216,"end":12242.636,"text":"verify sensitive observations,"},{"start":12243.456,"end":12243.836,"text":"that they"},{"start":12244.696,"end":12248.556,"text":"should just keep the information and not spread it,"},{"start":12249.096,"end":12252.536,"text":"and also that they should behave nice and"},{"start":12252.776,"end":12255.336,"text":"kindly with the reporters. There have been"},{"start":12255.396,"end":12259.316,"text":"some exceptions from"},{"start":12259.376,"end":12263.236,"text":"that, I can say, because they are a"},{"start":12263.756,"end":12264.536,"text":"little bit of the"},{"start":12265.396,"end":12268.856,"text":"ambassadors for the reporting systems together with the"},{"start":12268.936,"end":12269.436,"text":"support."},{"start":12270.416,"end":12272.876,"text":"So those are the ones who really met"},{"start":12274.196,"end":12275.076,"text":"the reporters."},{"start":12278.216,"end":12280.176,"text":"And today it's"},{"start":12281.436,"end":12282.636,"text":"close to 500"},{"start":12283.956,"end":12284.396,"text":"people that"},{"start":12285.556,"end":12287.196,"text":"we have contract with and some do"},{"start":12288.096,"end":12290.656,"text":"the verification of observations."},{"start":12292.116,"end":12292.416,"text":"And"},{"start":12293.556,"end":12294.296,"text":"Artportalen,"},{"start":12296.656,"end":12299.976,"text":"it's about seven and a half million reports"},{"start":12300.856,"end":12304.796,"text":"only on that system per year. Then we have other external system"},{"start":12304.856,"end":12307.036,"text":"as iNaturalist, observation.org,"},{"start":12308.016,"end":12311.556,"text":"some other smaller reporting system also"},{"start":12311.816,"end":12312.136,"text":"that"},{"start":12313.556,"end":12315.036,"text":"give us information."},{"start":12317.956,"end":12321.936,"text":"We have our herbarium system. We have our other"},{"start":12321.996,"end":12325.876,"text":"collections. So it's lots of information or"},{"start":12325.936,"end":12328.756,"text":"lots of observation to take care about."},{"start":12328.816,"end":12328.916,"text":"So"},{"start":12329.976,"end":12333.016,"text":"just from our portal, and it's about 20,000 observation per day."},{"start":12333.596,"end":12335.036,"text":"And then you see that you have"},{"start":12335.936,"end":12338.456,"text":"480 people that take care of them."},{"start":12339.336,"end":12340.516,"text":"And then we have a goal"},{"start":12341.796,"end":12342.416,"text":"that we should"},{"start":12343.536,"end":12347.436,"text":"reach about 10%. That what we think we have the possibility"},{"start":12347.456,"end":12348.716,"text":"to do in the long term"},{"start":12349.536,"end":12353.236,"text":"of all those observation, because many observation, we"},{"start":12354.056,"end":12358.016,"text":"don't have to care of common species that occur, that they should"},{"start":12358.076,"end":12358.536,"text":"occur."},{"start":12362.536,"end":12363.976,"text":"Thanks. They are"},{"start":12364.876,"end":12365.476,"text":"normally"},{"start":12367.936,"end":12368.276,"text":"okay,"},{"start":12369.456,"end":12372.836,"text":"or nobody care about if there are some wrong with them"},{"start":12373.556,"end":12377.216,"text":"because it's just those rare species, those threatened, and"},{"start":12378.176,"end":12381.736,"text":"these invasive species. But today we are,"},{"start":12382.536,"end":12383.216,"text":"overall,"},{"start":12384.156,"end":12384.336,"text":"on"},{"start":12385.156,"end":12389.076,"text":"a bit above. But if you go to around"},{"start":12389.136,"end":12391.156,"text":"the different organism groups, it's"},{"start":12392.276,"end":12395.836,"text":"a little bit of a bias there because the birds and the vascular"},{"start":12395.876,"end":12397.096,"text":"plants has"},{"start":12397.956,"end":12398.916,"text":"reasonably higher"},{"start":12400.816,"end":12401.456,"text":"percentage."},{"start":12403.076,"end":12403.516,"text":"But we"},{"start":12404.516,"end":12407.676,"text":"try to come there."},{"start":12411.316,"end":12411.656,"text":"But"},{"start":12412.676,"end":12416.656,"text":"what we struggle with now or have our thoughts about,"},{"start":12417.656,"end":12420.996,"text":"it's how to communicate this between"},{"start":12421.056,"end":12424.316,"text":"databases. Because as I said, we have the national system."},{"start":12425.016,"end":12428.996,"text":"It's quite easy, and especially if it's in-house, because"},{"start":12430.076,"end":12431.416,"text":"that we have the communication."},{"start":12432.264,"end":12436.103,"text":"But as soon we start to discuss with other"},{"start":12436.184,"end":12439.624,"text":"species, how should we communicate with them?"},{"start":12441.764,"end":12442.144,"text":"And"},{"start":12445.304,"end":12447.084,"text":"everything is more and more connected,"},{"start":12448.184,"end":12449.364,"text":"as we already heard on"},{"start":12450.364,"end":12451.824,"text":"so many other presentations"},{"start":12452.724,"end":12454.504,"text":"these two days so far."},{"start":12455.804,"end":12459.284,"text":"So there are need also for this quality"},{"start":12459.384,"end":12460.444,"text":"exchange to"},{"start":12461.304,"end":12462.264,"text":"go to the"},{"start":12467.324,"end":12471.244,"text":"primary repository for observation, so they change"},{"start":12471.304,"end":12474.284,"text":"back, because otherwise the wrong observation is still"},{"start":12474.584,"end":12475.844,"text":"circulating everywhere."},{"start":12477.664,"end":12481.324,"text":"So how to highlight problematic strange"},{"start":12481.404,"end":12482.004,"text":"observation,"},{"start":12482.964,"end":12486.684,"text":"and how to highlight that this is a good one."},{"start":12488.224,"end":12488.564,"text":"And"},{"start":12490.004,"end":12492.324,"text":"there are definitely need"},{"start":12493.344,"end":12495.544,"text":"for standard for that type of"},{"start":12496.503,"end":12497.904,"text":"communication on"},{"start":12498.924,"end":12499.804,"text":"verification."},{"start":12501.224,"end":12501.784,"text":"So that's"},{"start":12503.344,"end":12504.804,"text":"my main message."},{"start":12516.444,"end":12516.664,"text":"Hi."},{"start":12517.604,"end":12521.444,"text":"Are you publishing the verification status in Darwin Core as well, and"},{"start":12521.484,"end":12522.924,"text":"what term do you use for that?"},{"start":12531.444,"end":12534.464,"text":"No, we don't. Not the verification standard."},{"start":12534.644,"end":12538.564,"text":"It's just those different classes, and today it's mainly in our"},{"start":12539.064,"end":12541.084,"text":"internal system in Artportalen, but"},{"start":12541.944,"end":12543.584,"text":"there of course, is need of a"},{"start":12547.544,"end":12551.184,"text":"Darwin Core standard for this type of communication,"},{"start":12551.544,"end":12554.624,"text":"and I'm looking at some of the guys on the first row here now"},{"start":12555.884,"end":12559.864,"text":"because I'm not so much in the Darwin Core work."},{"start":12560.024,"end":12560.303,"text":"So,"},{"start":12561.484,"end":12565.344,"text":"I think there are others that is better to answer that question."},{"start":12566.184,"end":12569.784,"text":"If what's possible and what's already there to use."},{"start":12574.604,"end":12575.864,"text":"Very quick one. Yes."},{"start":12576.824,"end":12580.664,"text":"Can you tell us when to use verification versus"},{"start":12580.724,"end":12581.484,"text":"validation?"},{"start":12586.244,"end":12587.504,"text":"Yeah. We have the same word for"},{"start":12589.004,"end":12590.204,"text":"everything until"},{"start":12591.244,"end":12594.944,"text":"five, six years ago, I think, because the validation"},{"start":12595.024,"end":12597.984,"text":"is what was presented in the first three"},{"start":12598.564,"end":12600.504,"text":"presentation here, the technical one."},{"start":12600.564,"end":12604.384,"text":"Just to see if there are date, if there's a coordinate that exist, and"},{"start":12605.464,"end":12609.284,"text":"such that you don't need human to"},{"start":12610.364,"end":12610.964,"text":"do anything"},{"start":12612.144,"end":12613.404,"text":"except set rules."},{"start":12614.284,"end":12617.644,"text":"But verification in our terminology, it's"},{"start":12618.104,"end":12622.064,"text":"when we put the human eye and brain in looking"},{"start":12622.124,"end":12624.964,"text":"at the observation and set the"},{"start":12626.264,"end":12628.384,"text":"reliable status on it."},{"start":12629.604,"end":12630.784,"text":"So that's the difference."},{"start":12633.764,"end":12637.424,"text":"I'll just make one comment. I think one of the key issues here we recognized, of"},{"start":12637.484,"end":12641.464,"text":"course, is, well, you really want the reports on quality or fitness for"},{"start":12641.544,"end":12642.784,"text":"use to stay with the data."},{"start":12643.584,"end":12643.824,"text":"And"},{"start":12644.984,"end":12645.264,"text":"the"},{"start":12646.184,"end":12649.804,"text":"annotations is one mechanism, which is already a"},{"start":12650.084,"end":12653.304,"text":"W3C standard,"},{"start":12653.864,"end":12656.064,"text":"should easily enough accommodate that."},{"start":12657.564,"end":12658.704,"text":"But that's something for"},{"start":12660.304,"end":12661.924,"text":"annotations interest group again."},{"start":12663.584,"end":12665.664,"text":"Okay, I think we need to head on with the next one."}]